{"id":"b9e3d57e94ce36b7","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-free-variable-function.md","title":"Free Variable Function","display":"df-free-variable-function — Free Variable Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-free-variable-function","aliases":["92-df-free-variable-function"],"display":"df-free-variable-function — Free Variable Function","depends_on":["[[92-df-formula]]","[[92-df-term]]","[[92-df-signature]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-free-variable-function"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-free-variable-function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-free-variable-function — Free Variable Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-free-variable-function-—-Free-Variable-Function-$\\mathrm{free}$\">df-free-variable-function — Free Variable Function <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}\">\\(\\mathrm{free}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Term}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Term}_G\\)</span> (term set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef6f65f207e8439\" href=\"?note=4ef6f65f207e8439\" title=\"92-df-term\">92-df-term</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> (formula set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}_G\\)</span> (variable-symbol set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d666a3e3ee6c8148\" href=\"?note=d666a3e3ee6c8148\" title=\"92-df-signature\">92-df-signature</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span> (definition-target function)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{FV}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\to\\mathcal{P}(\\mathrm{Var}_G),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{FV}_G(0)=\\emptyset,\\qquad\n\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\\mathrm{FV}_G(x)=\\{x\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\;\\mathrm{FV}_G(S(t))=\\mathrm{FV}_G(t),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\;\\mathrm{FV}_G(s+t)=\\mathrm{FV}_G(s\\cdot t)=\\mathrm{FV}_G(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_G(t),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\;\\mathrm{FV}_G(s=t)=\\mathrm{FV}_G(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_G(t),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\neg\\varphi)=\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\,\\forall\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\\;\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)=\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\psi),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\,\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\,\\forall Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\;\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(Qx\\,\\varphi)=\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{FV}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\to\\mathcal{P}(\\mathrm{Var}_G),\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{FV}_G(0)=\\emptyset,\\qquad\n\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\\mathrm{FV}_G(x)=\\{x\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\;\\mathrm{FV}_G(S(t))=\\mathrm{FV}_G(t),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\;\\mathrm{FV}_G(s+t)=\\mathrm{FV}_G(s\\cdot t)=\\mathrm{FV}_G(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_G(t),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\;\\mathrm{FV}_G(s=t)=\\mathrm{FV}_G(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_G(t),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\neg\\varphi)=\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\,\\forall\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\\;\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)=\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\psi),\\\\\n&amp;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\,\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\,\\forall Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\;\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(Qx\\,\\varphi)=\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>的自由变量集</li>\n<li>自由变量：不在量词<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall x\">\\(\\forall x\\)</span>或<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x\">\\(\\exists x\\)</span>绑定的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span></li>\n<li>句子 = 自由变量集为空的公式</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}_G\\)</span>由项与公式的结构递归唯一确定</li>\n<li>用于定义句子和代入操作</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-free-variable-function-—-Free-Variable-Function-$\\mathrm{free}$","text":"df-free-variable-function — Free Variable Function $\\mathrm{free}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-signature]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"4ef6f65f207e8439","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Term}_G$ (term set, see [[92-df-term]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"5a1bd470754681a7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_G$ (formula set, see [[92-df-formula]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-signature","status":"resolved","id":"d666a3e3ee6c8148","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Var}_G$ (variable-symbol set, see [[92-df-signature]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{free}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Term}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}free\\text{-}variable\\text{-}function} \\vdash \\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{FV}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\cup\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\to\\mathcal{P}(\\mathrm{Var}_G),\\\\\n&\\mathrm{FV}_G(0)=\\emptyset,\\qquad\n\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\;\\mathrm{FV}_G(x)=\\{x\\},\\\\\n&\\forall t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\;\\mathrm{FV}_G(S(t))=\\mathrm{FV}_G(t),\\\\\n&\\forall s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\;\\mathrm{FV}_G(s+t)=\\mathrm{FV}_G(s\\cdot t)=\\mathrm{FV}_G(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_G(t),\\\\\n&\\forall s,t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_G\\;\\mathrm{FV}_G(s=t)=\\mathrm{FV}_G(s)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_G(t),\\\\\n&\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\;\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\neg\\varphi)=\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi),\\\\\n&\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\,\\forall\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to\\}\\;\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)=\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\psi),\\\\\n&\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\,\\forall x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_G\\,\\forall Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\;\n\\mathrm{FV}_G(Qx\\,\\varphi)=\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall x","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FV}_G","display":false}],"bytes":1873,"backlinks":[{"id":"f28281ca315fc78c","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6ed78135d2cc20c6","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FV}_G$ (free-variable function, see [[92-df-free-variable-function]])"},{"id":"2dc58bf648f8b3b2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FV}_G$ (free-variable function, see [[92-df-free-variable-function]])"},{"id":"83eb2b67a65ec154","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}$ and $\\mathrm{FV}_{\\in}$ (formulas and free-variable function for the first-order language $\\{\\in\\}$; language-indexed analogues of [[92-df-formula]] and [[92-df-free-variable-function]])"},{"id":"b12fbadd1e3ae795","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FV}_G$ (free-variable function, see [[92-df-free-variable-function]])"},{"id":"d754a154b50a9533","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\m